sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant API as Payment API
    participant Acc as Accounts and Wallet
    participant Cat as Biller Catalog
    participant Fee as Fees and Commissions
    participant Fraud as Fraud Checks
    participant Int as Biller Integration
    participant Bill as ElectroCo mock biller
    participant Notif as Notifications
    participant Aud as Audit Log

    Note over Customer,Aud: Step 1 - Login and limits
    Customer->>API: Login with phone and password
    API->>Acc: Identify user and read verification level
    Acc-->>API: Customer Sara, level BASIC, daily limit 5000.00 EGP from configuration
    API-->>Customer: Session token

    Note over Customer,Aud: Step 2 - Bill inquiry
    Customer->>API: Inquiry for ElectroCo with meter number
    API->>Cat: Check service is active and meter number is valid
    Cat-->>API: Active, min 5.00, max 10000.00
    API->>Int: inquire(meter number)
    Int->>Bill: Request bill for meter number
    Bill-->>Int: Amount due 350.00 EGP
    Int-->>API: Bill of 350.00 EGP

    Note over Customer,Aud: Step 3 - Fee and total
    API->>Fee: calculateFee(ELECTRICITY, 350.00)
    Fee-->>API: Fee 2.50 EGP
    API-->>Customer: Amount 350.00 + fee 2.50 = total 352.50 EGP

    Customer->>API: Pay with idempotency key
    API->>API: Look up idempotency key for this customer
    alt Key already used by an identical request
        API-->>Customer: Return the original result, no new payment
    else New key
        API->>API: Create payment in state Initiated
        API->>Aud: Record payment created

        Note over Customer,Aud: Step 4 - Fraud checks
        API->>Fraud: Run chain (blocked account, velocity, daily limit, min and max)
        alt A rule fails
            Fraud-->>API: Reject with reason code
            API->>API: Initiated to Rejected
            API->>Aud: Record rejection and reason
            API-->>Customer: Rejected with clear reason
        else All rules pass
            Fraud-->>API: Pass

            Note over Customer,Aud: Step 5 - Hold the money
            API->>Acc: holdFunds(352.50, payment reference)
            alt Available balance is lower than 352.50
                Acc-->>API: INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
                API->>API: Initiated to Rejected
                API-->>Customer: Rejected with INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
            else Hold succeeds
                Acc->>Acc: Ledger entries available -352.50 and held +352.50 (row lock)
                Acc->>Aud: Record hold with who, when and why
                Acc-->>API: Hold confirmed
                API->>API: Initiated to FundsHeld

                Note over Customer,Aud: Step 6 - Call the biller
                API->>API: FundsHeld to SentToBiller
                API->>Int: pay(unique reference, 350.00)
                Int->>Bill: Send payment with unique reference (timeout 10 seconds)

                Note over Customer,Aud: Step 7 - Confirmation
                alt Biller confirms paid
                    Bill-->>Int: Paid
                    Int-->>API: PAID
                    API->>Acc: Convert hold to final charge
                    Acc->>Acc: Ledger entries held -352.50, fee income +2.50, biller payable +350.00
                    opt Payment made at an agent terminal
                        API->>Fee: calculateCommission(fee 2.50)
                        Fee-->>API: Commission 1.00 EGP (40 percent of fee)
                        API->>Acc: Credit agent wallet 1.00 EGP
                    end
                    API->>API: SentToBiller to Completed
                    API->>Aud: Record charge, fee and commission
                    Note over Customer,Aud: Step 8 - Receipt
                    API-)Notif: PaymentCompleted event
                    Notif-)Customer: SMS and push message
                    API-->>Customer: Completed with reference
                else Biller refuses
                    Bill-->>Int: Refused with error code
                    Int-->>API: REFUSED
                    API->>API: SentToBiller to Failed
                    Note over API,Acc: Hold is released and payment becomes Refunded (see seq-refund)
                    API-)Notif: PaymentFailed event
                    API-->>Customer: Failed with clear reason
                else No answer within 10 seconds
                    API->>API: SentToBiller to Unknown
                    Note over API,Acc: Money stays held, never refunded automatically
                    API-)Int: Schedule re-queries after 1, 5 and 15 minutes
                    API-)Notif: PaymentProcessing event
                    API-->>Customer: Payment is being processed
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over Bill,Aud: Step 9 (night reconciliation) is a separate batch flow and is not part of this online sequence
